Rules to follow when building the package "dock_apriltag_localizer" in the ardu_ws workspace:
- The package "dock_apriltag_localizer" must be built using the virtual "apriltag_venv" in ardu_ws folder with the following commands:
python -m colcon build --symlink-install --packages-select dock_apriltag_localizer

The ardupilot firware version 4.7.0 to match real drone firware.

